 Fail2Ban SSH Protection Lab

 Objective
Detect and block brute force SSH attacks.

 Setup
- Attacker: Kali Linux
- Victim: Ubuntu Server

 Attack
Used Hydra to brute-force SSH login.

 Logs Observed
/var/log/auth.log

 Defense
Configured Fail2Ban jail for SSH.

 Result
- Attacker IP banned after multiple attempts
- Verified using:
  sudo fail2ban-client status sshd

 Key Learning
- Importance of log monitoring
- Automated defense reduces attack surface
